# Self-hosted STT model tarballs. Ignored by default, with one exception: the
# Indian-English model MUST be committed and deployed, because it has to be
# served same-origin — cross-origin hosts (GitHub Release assets in particular)
# fail the browser's CORS check on the redirect. See src/audio/models.ts.
public/models/*.tar.gz
!public/models/vosk-model-small-en-in-0.4.tar.gz

# Model repacking (scripts/repack-en-in-model.sh). Big binaries — these are
# uploaded as GitHub Release assets, never committed.
dist-models/
scripts/.model-work/

